  "transcript": "Welcome to Echo Event Services, where music, production and thoughtful planning come together to create memorable events. Serving Toronto and the Greater Toronto Area, Echo brings entertainment, sound, lighting and visual experiences to weddings, engagements, birthdays, graduations, private parties and corporate gatherings. Whether you are planning an intimate celebration or a larger occasion, we help you shape an experience that reflects your people, your style and your vision.\n\nAt the heart of Echo is DJ Khalil Nahhat, bringing over a decade of experience to Arabic and multicultural celebrations. Each performance takes shape around your musical preferences, your guests and the rhythm of your event. From welcoming guests and setting the atmosphere to entrances, first dances and a full dance floor, the music connects each part of the celebration. MC hosting and announcements help guide those moments, keeping your guests informed and your event moving smoothly.\n\nBeyond the music, Echo offers sound systems, microphones, event lighting, LED screens and special effects. Create a welcoming atmosphere for a reception, clear sound for speeches, dynamic lighting for the dance floor or a visual backdrop for your key moments. Explore effects such as low-lying fog, cold sparks and CO₂, with selections coordinated around your venue’s requirements and the setting of your event. Individual equipment rentals and equipment sets give you options for building the setup that suits your plans.\n\nThe Echo app brings these possibilities into one place. Explore services, discover equipment and review the details of each option. Use the three-dimensional setup simulation to visualize an illustrative arrangement of your event space and explore how equipment could fit within it. Check date availability, share your venue and guest details, and build a personalized event request. Echo’s AI assistant can help you navigate the options and organize your ideas as you plan.\n\nYou can also discover DJ Khalil’s musical work through mixes, remixes, mashups, medleys, covers and live performances. Browse photographs and customer reviews to get a feel for past celebrations. When a live session is available, sign in to watch, share comments and submit song requests—bringing you closer to the music and the experience behind Echo.\n\nWhen you are ready to take the next step, connect directly with our team to discuss your priorities, refine your selections and coordinate the details. Your request begins a conversation, and your date is reserved once Echo confirms your booking. From your first idea to the final song, our aim is to bring the right elements together with care, so you can enjoy the occasion and the people who make it meaningful.\n\nEcho Event Services. Your people. Your music. A celebration that feels like you.",
